          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open any pack under Sticker Packs and tap Add to WhatsApp. Still and animated stickers become separate packs, and a big pack is split evenly, so every one fits WhatsApp's rules. Pick each sticker's emoji before you send." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-CN" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在“贴纸包”中打开任意贴纸包，点按“添加到 WhatsApp”。静态和动态贴纸会分成不同的包，过大的包会平均拆分，以符合 WhatsApp 的规则。发送前可为每张贴纸选择表情符号。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在「貼圖包」中打開任何貼圖包，點按「加入到 WhatsApp」。靜態和動態貼圖會分成不同的包，過大的包會平均拆分，以符合 WhatsApp 的規則。傳送前可為每張貼圖選擇表情符號。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
